/// M30 HISTORY-047 "Generated fresh: roots green".
/// Source: tests/baseline/t26_product_guide_test.go
/// static baseline for TestT26GeneratedArtifactsFresh
/// (L209-213) plus the probe args (L213), the dir
/// bind (L214), the run call (L215), the stat join
/// (L218) and the Fatal call shape (L216, L220).
/// Disposition: replace_support (this row ports the
/// generated-fresh offline pact to ordinary Can
/// functions; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row,
/// variant, environment and control has accepted
/// evidence).
/// Protects (this file): the static baseline as the
/// green root: the test symbol plus param, the two
/// comment lines, the root helper, the cataloguegen
/// path plus check flag, the catalogue seg, the
/// stat plus CombinedOutput plus Join call shapes,
/// and the Fatal call shape.
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): test-name
/// pins the TestT26GeneratedArtifactsFresh symbol
/// (L211); test-param pins t *testing.T (L211);
/// comment-fresh pins the fresh line (L209);
/// comment-truth pins the truth line (L210);
/// root-helper pins the repoRoot call (L212);
/// cataloguegen-path pins the probe path (L213);
/// check-flag pins --check (L213, L216);
/// catalogue-seg pins catalogue.ts (L218, L220);
/// stat-call pins os.Stat (L218); combined-call pins
/// cmd.CombinedOutput() (L215); join-head pins the
/// Join head before the quoted segs (L218);
/// fatal-call pins t.Fatalf (L216, L220).
/// Facet map (static baseline): test-name pins the
/// symbol (L211); test-param pins the param (L211);
/// comment-fresh pins the line (L209); comment-truth
/// pins the line (L210); root-helper pins the call
/// (L212); cataloguegen-path pins the path (L213);
/// check-flag pins the flag (L213, L216);
/// catalogue-seg pins the seg (L218, L220);
/// stat-call pins the call (L218); combined-call pins
/// the call (L215); join-head pins the head (L218);
/// fatal-call pins the call (L216, L220).
/// The verdict pins live in
/// history-047-base-semantics.can; the run shape plus
/// diagnostics live in history-047-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none (row lists zero variants; the single
/// passing path in Go order).
/// Environment: none (row lists zero gates; requires
/// [] offline; binds at P23).
/// Logical gates SUITE/WORK/FILES/BUILD/CHILD/PROC/CLOCK
/// bind at P23; no live run now. Accept gate P23 is
/// unmet. Timeout 120000ms is the offline default bound
/// (no Go test timeout in this row; binds at P23 like
/// the M11 no-gate rows).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case history/generated-fresh-roots checks: test-name,
/// test-param, comment-fresh, comment-truth,
/// root-helper, cataloguegen-path, check-flag,
/// catalogue-seg, stat-call, combined-call, join-head,
/// fatal-call.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later
/// integrator decision.
